{"id":"f626099313d4c0b8","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md","title":"基础去引号相对一致而自指全模式不一致","display":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号相对一致而自指全模式不一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-T-schema-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-T-schema-consistency"],"display":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号相对一致而自指全模式不一致","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-T-schema-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-T-schema-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-T-schema-consistency — 基础去引号相对一致而自指全模式不一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (基础算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 一致)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (只对基础闭句加入去引号实例, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0[T]\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0[T]\\)</span> (自指真理语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (经典逻辑演绎闭包)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>\n(PA 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 的语法编码支持对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{TB}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{TB}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 前提下</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式通过模型扩张证明：在任一 PA 模型的外部，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 解释为基础句的\n满足集合，即得到 TB 模型。因此必须先假设 PA 一致；真理公理不能修复\n不一致的基础理论。</p>\n<p>第二式用对角引理构造说谎者，再把该句自身的 T-schema 与对角式合成。\n不一致来自经典、自指、全透明的组合。KF 和 FS 都没有把这个不受限制的\n自指全模式作为公理，不能在处理方式表中把它们说成该模式的普通实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ (只对基础闭句加入去引号实例, see [[91-df-TB]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0[T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{TB}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{FullT}(\\mathrm{PA},T)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1881,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","ba367ff1b4bb3da3","41fdad0bfaff0bf5"]}